# Copy to .env (chmod 600). Empty BB_BASE_URL = guest-only, no sign-in.
# BB_BASE_URL: public origin, e.g. https://broombuster.com (also the passkey domain).
BB_BASE_URL=
# Optional: BB_CSP=report-only relaxes the enforced Content-Security-Policy (debugging).
# Optional: BB_511_API_KEY (511.org open-data token) adds Bay Area work zones to the street closures.
# Layer builds only (not the server): BB_NREL_API_KEY (developer.nlr.gov) for the EV charging layer;
# without it DEMO_KEY is used, which allows a handful of requests an hour.
